CM_ SG_ 282 FR_CMR_SCCEquipSta "This signal indicates equipment for SCC";
CM_ SG_ 282 FR_CMR_ReqADASMapMsgVal "This signal indicates an ADAS map message request from FR_CMR to H_U. Each bit indicates the request messages as follows. - Bit 0 : H_U_NAVI_V2_STUB_E - Bit 1 : HU_NAVI_V2_PROSHORT_E_00 (곡률) - Bit 2 : HU_NAVI_V2_PROSHORT_E_00 (곡률 ???�보)";
